WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.138
Module 2: the GPO sunset
and policy migration.

2
00:00:04.138 --> 00:00:06.238
This is the existing-fleet program.

3
00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:10.804
It replaces Group Policy Objects on
endpoints that are already deployed,

4
00:00:10.804 --> 00:00:13.799
and it ends when those
GPOs are formally retired.

5
00:00:13.799 --> 00:00:18.912
The program measures it by GPOs retired
with evidence, not by settings copied.

6
00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:20.974
Chapter 07 runs it as a program,

7
00:00:20.974 --> 00:00:26.662
Chapter 08 is what an endpoint engineer
works from inside those rules, and Appendix

8
00:00:26.662 --> 00:00:31.990
A is the crosswalk: where a control lands
in Intune, not what its value should be.
